pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 34, 400, 20]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      wrap: false
      text: 01 · 运动特征
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 58, 760, 36]
    content:
      style: "$h1"
      wrap: false
      text: 一场网球赛，身体在经历什么？
  - elementId: headrule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 104, 840, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: stat1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 130, 250, 70]
    content:
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:30px; color:$court;"><strong>1.5–5 h</strong></span></p>
        <p style="margin-top:4px"><span style="font-size:12px; color:$muted;">一场比赛的时长跨度</span></p>
  - elementId: stat2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 216, 250, 70]
    content:
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:30px; color:$court;"><strong>4–10 s</strong></span></p>
        <p style="margin-top:4px"><span style="font-size:12px; color:$muted;">每一分球的爆发时长</span></p>
  - elementId: stat3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 302, 250, 70]
    content:
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:30px; color:$court;"><strong>140–180</strong></span></p>
        <p style="margin-top:4px"><span style="font-size:12px; color:$muted;">比赛中心率（次/分）</span></p>
  - elementId: stat4
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 388, 250, 70]
    content:
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:30px; color:$court;"><strong>3–5 km</strong></span></p>
        <p style="margin-top:4px"><span style="font-size:12px; color:$muted;">全场累计跑动距离</span></p>
  - elementId: vline
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [350, 130, 1, 328]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: sec1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [390, 126, 510, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      bold: true
      color: "$court"
      wrap: false
      text: 供能系统：三种燃料接力
  - elementId: bar1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [390, 158, 153, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$court"}
  - elementId: bar2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [543, 158, 128, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#3E7D54"}
  - elementId: bar3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [671, 158, 229, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$lime"}
  - elementId: barlabel1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [390, 204, 153, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 11.5
      color: "$muted"
      align: [center, top]
      wrap: false
      text: 磷酸原 · 每分爆发
  - elementId: barlabel2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [543, 204, 128, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 11.5
      color: "$muted"
      align: [center, top]
      wrap: false
      text: 糖酵解 · 相持
  - elementId: barlabel3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [671, 204, 229, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 11.5
      color: "$muted"
      align: [center, top]
      wrap: false
      text: 有氧系统 · 整场底座
  - elementId: explain
    elementType: text
    bounds: [390, 222, 510, 236]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p>网球是典型的<strong>间歇性高强度运动</strong>：每一分是短时爆发，分与分之间是 20–90 秒的间歇，整场比赛又持续数小时。</p>
        <p style="margin-top:10px">这意味着它同时向三个供能系统要能量——每分靠磷酸原系统瞬间出力，多拍相持依赖糖酵解，而整场的恢复与耐力底座的维护全靠有氧系统。</p>
        <p style="margin-top:10px"><strong>营养上的推论</strong>：既要有随时可用的糖（肌糖原），又要有支撑数小时的能量总量，还要兼顾恢复——这就是网球专项营养策略的出发点。</p>
  - elementId: footnote
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 486, 700, 34]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      text: 依据：《运动营养学》通用教材与网球项目研究文献的常见口径，数值为范围而非精确值。
  - elementId: pagenum
    elementType: text
    bounds: [880, 500, 40, 20]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [right, top]
      wrap: false
      text: 02
